  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile input and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103, outperforming the previous multimodal singleprofile baseline (0.5266). The results suggest potential benefits from multiprofile aggregation, but the exact contribution of multiprofile versus avgpool remains uncertain due to lack of direct comparison with alternative aggregation methods. Further experiments isolating these factors would clarify their individual impacts."
